silm:instances_papers_07_the_canonical_question_chapters_02_typed_legs_of_the_question_sections_01_cat_anchor_leg_yoneda_hom_leg_1 silm:hasExample "In 'P07TypedLegsOfTheQuestionCatAnchorLegYonedaHomLeg1', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, VetRecord_77 is the clinical-record information artifact about Mittens; it depicts Mittens via a typed aboutness arrow and is not itself the cat." .
